  "source_semantic_controls": [
    "Published 40-day-gap and 41-day-catch examples are instantiated with fresh explicit dates. The latter has 30+41+30=101 total outer days, leaving the short-total A02 interpretation open. A 1/10-ha gap can coexist with overall 85-percent compliance; a local gap diagnostic is not a whole-farm failure.",
    "The arable-only control separates known permanent grassland. Current domestic MFA meaning, actual holding completeness and any time-varying parcel ownership must be bound; no new possession formula is invented.",
    "A completed September-to-December terminal gap stipulates no following crop and counts the whole exceeded interval; a known closed cross-year 50-day control is distinct from unknown future planting.",
    "The August 12 relief names 30/50-day establishment periods and retains other duties. A known 17-day catch-to-catch renewal gap is not immediate, irrespective of the disclosed zero-day operational convention.",
    "Rounding is independently isolated by exact rational arithmetic: 15002/100013 exceeds 3/20 by 1/2000260, greater than native 1e-9 tolerance, but rounds to 3/20 at six decimal places. Two-decimal hectare facts avoid inventing sub-resolution measured areas; no official assessment or sanction is inferred.",
    "The actual planting-day boundary is tested with a coherent undersowing-harvest then non-ground-level care event on the same day, retaining the winter stand. Destructive operations with contradictory later end dates are not presented as ordinary source gold.",
    "Mechanical method membership omits frost qualifiers that separate native diagnoses do check. An asserted method key does not override explicit contrary actual frost/component facts. The missing local PSM diagnosis is distinct from payment or a complete lawful-use decision.",
    "Positive mixture, seed-proof and chopping-evidence consumers; current-year participation filtering; arable aggregation; additional personal fields; reentry diagnoses; and current control-refusal payment blocking are preserved as actual improvements.",
    "Known own-account and reentry failures do not all reach the contract gate. Actual outside-Austria parcels can fill the access sum despite a separate payment exclusion. Historical records require current-year scope; these are distinct consumers.",
    "The April 15 takeover case expressly stipulates an actual proper application and AMA approval absent from the model fields. It diagnoses a conditional authority-exception interface, not approval inferred from dates. The early-harvest drought case likewise stipulates its actual usual harvest season and lack of individual recognition, not a closed crop-name rule.",
    "The current drought-harvest helper positively requires no harvestable crop and region, an improvement over a geography-only helper. The notice crop-season scope and complete authority context remain separate.",
    "A computed premium despite failed coverage does not by itself prove a legally required full reduction. Raw A15 leaves assessed content sanctions external. The existing sanction helper and reduction list are not consumed by the amount; a final legally assessed deduction is not invented.",
    "Home-versus-alpine modulation, guaranteed versus actual budget-dependent rate and discretionary 50-EUR waiver remain conditional amount scopes. Current crop lists are correct stored classifications, not an executable botanical approval engine.",
    "A02 short-total invalid catches, immediate renewal/one-day rolling, late-mixture reading, frost-rolling hierarchy, NAPV dates, late-acquisition causality, ES-Acker following-year scope, parcel payment allocation and revision/Art-70 context retain their disclosed limits."
  ],
